<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= item (base : string) (e : page.entry) : string =\n    := link = base ++# \"/\" ++# html.escape e.slug ++# \"/\"\n    \"<item><title>\"\n    ++# html.escape e.title\n    ++# \"</title><link>\"\n    ++# link\n    ++# \"</link><guid>\"\n    ++# link\n    ++# \"</guid>\"\n    ++# \"<dc:date>\"\n    ++# html.escape e.date\n    ++# \"</dc:date><description>\"\n    ++# html.escape e.blurb\n    ++# \"</description></item>\"\n\n:= ^ items (base : string) (entries : list page.entry) : string =\n    ?= entries ?|\n    | [] => \"\"\n    | e :: rest => item base e ++# items base rest\n\n:= render_feed (title : string) (base : string) (entries : list page.entry) : string =\n    \"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>\"\n    ++# \"<rss version=\\\"2.0\\\" xmlns:dc=\\\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\\\"><channel>\"\n    ++# \"<title>\"\n    ++# html.escape title\n    ++# \"</title><link>\"\n    ++# base\n    ++# \"/</link><description>\"\n    ++# html.escape title\n    ++# \"</description>\"\n    ++# items base entries\n    ++# \"</channel></rss>\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := item (base : string) (e : page.entry) : string =
      := link = base ++# "/" ++# html.escape e.slug ++# "/"
      "<item><title>"
      ++# html.escape e.title
      ++# "</title><link>"
      ++# link
      ++# "</link><guid>"
      ++# link
      ++# "</guid>"
      ++# "<dc:date>"
      ++# html.escape e.date
      ++# "</dc:date><description>"
      ++# html.escape e.blurb
      ++# "</description></item>"

  := ^ items (base : string) (entries : list page.entry) : string =
      ?= entries ?|
      | [] => ""
      | e :: rest => item base e ++# items base rest

  := render_feed (title : string) (base : string) (entries : list page.entry) : string =
      "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>"
      ++# "<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"><channel>"
      ++# "<title>"
      ++# html.escape title
      ++# "</title><link>"
      ++# base
      ++# "/</link><description>"
      ++# html.escape title
      ++# "</description>"
      ++# items base entries
      ++# "</channel></rss>"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### the_feed_links_each_post_by_its_slug (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_feed \"Spiral Blog\" \"https://i574n.github.io/blog\" [ page.sample () ]\n|> sm'.contains \"<item><title>Sample Entry</title><link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/sample/</link>\"\n|> _assert_eq !+","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_feed "Spiral Blog" "https://i574n.github.io/blog" [ page.sample () ]
  |> sm'.contains "<item><title>Sample Entry</title><link>https://i574n.github.io/blog/sample/</link>"
  |> _assert_eq !+
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### the_feed_is_rss_2_with_dublin_core_dates (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_feed \"Spiral Blog\" \"https://i574n.github.io/blog\" [ page.sample () ]\n|> \\ feed =>\n    (feed |> sm'.starts_with \"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?><rss version=\\\"2.0\\\"\")\n    && (feed |> sm'.contains \"<dc:date>2026-10-17</dc:date>\")\n|> _assert_eq !+","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_feed "Spiral Blog" "https://i574n.github.io/blog" [ page.sample () ]
  |> \ feed =>
      (feed |> sm'.starts_with "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?><rss version=\"2.0\"")
      && (feed |> sm'.contains "<dc:date>2026-10-17</dc:date>")
  |> _assert_eq !+
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
